To: devicetree@vger.kernel.org, linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, linux-pm@vger.kernel.org, linux-samsung-soc@vger.kernel.org
Cc: b.zolnierkie@samsung.com, krzk@kernel.org, kgene@kernel.org, cw00.choi@samsung.com, kyungmin.park@samsung.com, m.szyprowski@samsung.com, s.nawrocki@samsung.com, myungjoo.ham@samsung.com, Lukasz Luba <l.luba@partner.samsung.com>, Michael Turquette <mturquette@baylibre.com>, Stephen Boyd <sboyd@kernel.org>, linux-clk@vger.kernel.org, linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
